        "question": "How Gottfried really died?",
        "answer": "Harriet says she shoved Gottfried into the water and held him under with an oar until he stopped struggling. Martin was there afterward, when Gottfried was still floating in the water. [E1] [E2]",
        "citations": [
          "[E1]",
          "[E2]"
